--!strict
-- Rooftops2 greybox (vault/01 Design/Maps/Rooftops2.md; the 2026-11-05 redesign of Rooftops, which is never
-- touched): the collision and gameplay layer, and the
-- finished roof edges (parapets, coping, piers, ledges, sills and the roof membranes are plain Parts
-- that stay visible; the art pass hides the rest under kit pieces).
-- Bundle: python tools/studio/maps/bundle.py Rooftops2 Greybox -o rooftops2_greybox.luau
-- and run it in the match place, edit mode (Command Bar or the Studio MCP). Re-runnable: it rebuilds
-- every Greybox section, the spawns and the barriers of Workspace.Rooftops2. Not in the match rotation:
-- Studio Workspace attribute ForceMap = "Rooftops2" loads it. The Art pass restyles the visible parts by
-- their Look / Tone attributes from tools/maps/rooftops2_style.py.
--
-- The LAYOUT block is generated by tools/maps/rooftops2_layout.py --write from the layout that passed
-- its checks (z-fighting, clipping, slits, sightlines, spawn safety, routes). Change the layout there,
-- never here. Every part carries attributes for the art pass: Kind, Art (the kit piece that replaces
-- it) and Tone (the building's brick).

